#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/language/tile_schedule/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"Holds everything shared across GEMM variants: the grid geometry, the "
"stateless ``_swizzle`` / ``coord`` decode, the persistent-block-index "
"advance, and the ``init`` / ``valid`` / ``next_block`` loop protocol. "
"Concrete variants subclass this and implement ``_step`` (advance one block + "
"set ``m_idx`` / ``n_idx`` / ``valid_flag``); grouped variants add their own "
"state and ``_init_state``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/language/tile_schedule/index.rst:57
msgid ""
"Each persistent core independently walks the global ``(m_block, n_block)`` "
"grid. The block index handed out on iteration ``current_iter`` is "
"``current_iter * num_cores + core_id``, mapped to a tile by ``_swizzle``. "
"Usage::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/language/tile_schedule/index.rst:61
msgid ""
"sched = T.AscendTileScheduler(block_m=BM, block_n=BN,\n"
"                        num_cores=NUM_CORES, shape_m=M, shape_n=N)\n"
"sched.init(bx)\n"
"while sched.valid():\n"
"    m_tile, n_tile = sched.m_idx[0], sched.n_idx[0]\n"
"    # ... compute tile (m_tile, n_tile) ...\n"
"    sched.next_block()"
msgstr ""

